{
  "id": "theleague",
  "name": "TheLeague",
  "description": "TheLeague blue on neutral gray surfaces. The default theme: it also styles any page whose <html> names no league.",
  "notes": {
    "--btn-secondary-text": "Dark: the secondary button is logo-green emerald with near-black text — white on #10b981 is only ~3:1, #121212 is ~6.4:1.",
    "--card-bg": "Dark: a GRADIENT (slate glow from the top-left fading to #333), valid only in the background shorthand. Use --card-surface (solid) for color-mix / background-color.",
    "--color-primary-fill": "Dark: --color-primary #3b82f6 is the TEXT blue and carries white at only 3.68:1; fills under text use #2563eb (white 5.17:1), the dark primary button's blue.",
    "--on-league-accent": "Text ON a --league-accent fill: white where white clears AA on the accent, near-black where it does not (a bright dark-mode accent carries white at under 4.5:1).",
    "--hero-ink": "The deep hero ground: dark-mode hero cards, the hero CTA buttons in light, and ink ON a white hero button.",
    "--hero-accent": "The hero's highlight as TEXT on the hero card (white in light, --hero-ink in dark) and as the fill under the featured badge's ink — it has to clear contrast against both.",
    "--hero-gradient": "The composite hero's ground. Null keeps the composite hero's per-variant ramp (TheLeague's blues).",
    "--hero-anchor": "The dark end of event gradients (the gold keeper/auction card ends in it). Null keeps the navy #16324a.",
    "--league-accent-hover": "Hover step of a --league-accent fill: darker under white text, lighter under dark text, so hovering never lowers the text's contrast.",
    "--hero-action": "The button fill on a dark hero card (the schedule hero). Null keeps that hero's own #1d4ed8, white 6.4:1."
  },
